OL,3,AFamilies hit by long waits for dementia
OL,4,Adiagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of families say they have had
OL,7,Fto wait months or even years for a
OL,8,Fdementia diagnosis for a loved one.
OL,10,FSuch long delays have an impact on
OL,11,Ftheir own work, finances and mental
OL,12,Fhealth, a survey for the Alzheimer's
OL,13,FSociety charity reveals.
OL,15,FThe charity is calling for a national
OL,16,Fstandard that would mean someone with
OL,17,Fdementia would receive an accurate
OL,18,Fdiagnosis within 18 weeks of being seen
OL,19,Fand referred by a GP.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
